{'symbol': 'RL', 'date': '2023-05-25 08:01:00', 'title': 'RALPH LAUREN REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR FISCAL 2023 RESULTS AHEAD OF EXPECTATIONS; PROVIDES INITIAL OUTLOOK FOR FISCAL 2024', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--RALPH LAUREN CORPORATION (NYSE:RL), A GLOBAL LEADER IN THE DESIGN, MARKETING, AND DISTRIBUTION OF LUXURY LIFESTYLE PRODUCTS, TODAY REPORTED EARNINGS PER DILUTED SHARE OF $0.48 ON A REPORTED BASIS AND $0.90 ON AN ADJUSTED BASIS, EXCLUDING RESTRUCTURING-RELATED AND OTHER NET CHARGES, FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER OF FISCAL 2023. THIS COMPARED TO EARNINGS PER DILUTED SHARE OF $0.34 ON A REPORTED BASIS AND $0.49 ON AN ADJUSTED BASIS, EXCLUDING RESTRUCTURING-RELATED AND OTHER NET.'}